# Scaffolding Plan for Chandra OCR Demo Application

This plan outlines the architecture, files, and commands to scaffold a beautiful, premium full-stack Chandra OCR demo application. 

The application tech stack includes:
* **Frontend**: React (Vite) + Tailwind CSS + Axios
* **Backend**: FastAPI + Uvicorn + Server-Sent Events (SSE)
* **Communication**: REST for API requests, SSE for streaming real-time OCR execution logs/status.

---

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> We will scaffold a complete, working skeleton with a premium dashboard UI. The OCR service will contain stubbed/mocked methods for now, and real-time processing will be simulated using Server-Sent Events (SSE) to demonstrate the streaming workflow from backend to frontend.
